{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1381323-shallowings","id":1381323,"title":"Shallowings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-14T07:47:45-07:00","id":1381323,"title":"Shallowings","content":"So I'm looking for ideas, or RAW on how a shallowing works into crossing the Gauntlet. <br /> <br /> If there is a large shallowing with numerous people inside its confines and the Gauntlet suddenly goes up in rating what side of reality with those inside be on? The Penumbra or Physical Reality? <br /> <br /> If the people were to step outside the boundaries of a Shallowing how do they intentionally enter the Umbra and not stay in Physical Reality?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T10:41:34-07:00","id":1381369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tuch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1381323-shallowings#post1381323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there is a large shallowing with numerous people inside its confines and the Gauntlet suddenly goes up in rating what side of reality with those inside be on? The Penumbra or Physical Reality?</div> </div> </div> </div>The way I would do that it's physical beings remain in the physical world and ephemeral beings remain in the spirit world. After all, to separate matter and sprit it's what the Gauntlet does.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If the people were to step outside the boundaries of a Shallowing how do they intentionally enter the Umbra and not stay in Physical Reality? </div> </div> </div>I guess that people that knows could willingly chose. The way I would do it, others may get lost in one or the other side. After all, getting lost and entering a magical land it's classic fiction.<br /> <br /> Umbral travel is part vision quest, usually travelers end in places that resonate with their metal state, desires and fears regardless of what directions do they take. I imagine a sleeper entering a Shalowing could end in the Umbra if they're in a mental state that would resonate with the nearby Umbra, or with *not* being grounded in reality somehow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T12:10:26-07:00","id":1381391,"title":"","content":"Not all Shallowings are going to hit full Gauntlet 0 aka the physical and Umbra get mixed up. Most of them (or at least most of the area around them) is going to be in the Gauntlet 1-2 range where you can see &quot;through&quot; the Gauntlet and entities with the power to crossover can do so automatically. This keeps, for the most part, things that can't/don't cross under their own power on their natural side of things while the Shallowing lasts.<br /> <br /> Actually having a zero Gauntlet Shallowing means things are supposed to get jumbled, and who ends up where is rife for plot hooks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T12:20:53-07:00","id":1381396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1381323-shallowings?p=1381391#post1381391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually having a zero Gauntlet Shallowing means things are supposed to get jumbled, and who ends up where is rife for plot hooks.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is my aim as the ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}